{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, because of its inadequate Energy Statement with numerous omissions and shortcomings and failure to submit a signed legal agreement committing to offset any remaining emissions not mitigated onsite through a cash-in-lieu carbon offset payment, would lead to generation of excessive amounts of greenhouse gases and fail to mitigate climate change and the Council's net zero carbon requirements contrary to the Council's Climate Change Mitigation and Adaptation SPD (2025), Local Plan policies EQ1, EQ2, London Plan policy SI2 and the intent of NPPF.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, by reason of its excessive height and scale, would be an intrusive, incongruous and overdevelopment for this site, out of scale and character with the prevailing pattern of development in the locality, as well as having a serious and adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by occupants of neighbouring property. Thus, it is contrary to Local Plan policies CC1 and CC2, London Plan policy D3 and the NPPF. ",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal, by reason of its excessive height and scale, would be an intrusive and unneighbourly addition, resulting a serious and adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by occupants of neighbouring properties causing an overbearing impact, overlooking with an increased sense of enclosure, loss outlook and privacy contrary to Local Plan policies CC1 and CC2, London Plan policy D3 and the NPPF.",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposal makes insufficient provision for amenity and internal space to be provided at the site and within the dwellings, failure to show how the development would be designed to prevent harmful noise and air pollution exposure within the proposed flats; and so would be detrimental to the amenities enjoyed by prospective occupants of this development by creation of substandard quality of accommodation as well as being out of character with the prevailing pattern of the development in the surrounding area contrary to the Local Plan policies SC5, EQ4, EQ5, London Plan policies D6, D14 and S1 and the NPPF. "
  ],
